title: Achievements
new-page: true
on-departure: {!
window.disableFocusMode()
!}
on-arrival: {!
window.enableFocusMode()
!}

= Achievements guide

= Rheinland in Flammen

[? if achievement_ruhrland :
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(227,0,15,0.1)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(227,0,15,0.25)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/ruhrland.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Rheinland in Flammen</strong> - Young Plan goes horribly wrong...!}[? if game_achievement_ruhrland : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}
?]
[? if not achievement_ruhrland :
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/ruhrland.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Rheinland in Flammen</strong> - Young Plan goes horribly wrong...</div></div>!}
?]

The achievement above will require you to: Just not send in Schacht or alternatively alienate DVP/industrialists, so Schacht goes alone and breaks the stuff.

= Tirol Donau Pakt

[? if achievement_tyrole_danubia :
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(0,146,70,0.1)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(0,146,70,0.25)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/tyrole_danubia.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Tirol-Donau-Pakt</strong> - Italy and Germany have signed a non aggression treaty.!}[? if game_achievement_tyrole_danubia : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}
?]
[? if not achievement_tyrole_danubia :
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/tyrole_danubia.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Tirol-Donau-Pakt</strong> - Italy and Germany have signed a non aggression treaty.</div></div>!}
?]

Be sure to increase relations with Italy through Foreign Policy card. When you enter the 1932 date, sign the Treaty.

= Der Drei Speere

[? if achievement_revolution_own :
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(227,0,15,0.1)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(227,0,15,0.25)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/revolution_own.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Revolution der drei Speere</strong> - SPD has launched the revolution.!}[? if game_achievement_revolution_own : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}
?]
[? if not achievement_revolution_own :
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/revolution_own.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Revolution der drei Speere</strong> - SPD has launched the revolution.</div></div>!}
?]

Requires just to have left ideology and strong reichsbanner. Once you meet these conditions, launch revolution in Reichsbanner card.

= Volksfront

[? if achievement_popular_frontier :
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(227,0,15,0.1)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(227,0,15,0.25)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/popular_frontier.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Volksfront</strong> - The Popular Front theses has been established.!}[? if game_achievement_popular_frontier : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}
?]
[? if not achievement_popular_frontier :
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/popular_frontier.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Volksfront</strong> - The Popular Front theses has been established.</div></div>!}
?]

Requires by the time of activation: powerful far right, good kpd relation, high kpd co-operation, good z & ddp relations and powerful left + center factions strength

= Winterschwelen

[? if achievement_winterschwelen :	
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(140, 200, 235, 0.15)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(140, 200, 235, 0.35)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/winterschwelen.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Winterschwelen</strong> - The cold and despairly winter envelops the landvolk...!}[? if game_achievement_winterschwelen : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}	
?]
[? if not achievement_winterschwelen :	
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/winterschwelen.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Winterschwelen</strong> - The cold and despairly winter envelops the landvolk...</div></div>!}
?]

Good luck trying out this. Even code won't help you with that.

= Landlicher Zorn

[? if achievement_landlicher_zorn :	
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(46,79,46,0.15)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(20,20,20,0.35)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/landlicher_zorn.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Ländlicher Zorn</strong> - Rural wrath engulfes the Germany...!}[? if game_achievement_landlicher_zorn : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}	
?]
[? if not achievement_landlicher_zorn :	
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/landlicher_zorn.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Ländlicher Zorn</strong> - Rural wrath engulfes Germany...</div></div>!}
?]

Try it out first.

= Landpopulistenurteil

[? if achievement_karl_hepp_rlb :	
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(88, 112, 48, 0.20)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(88, 112, 48, 0.45)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/karlhepprlb.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Landpopulistenurteil</strong> - Karl Hepp has been elected as president of the Reichslandbund (RLB).!}[? if game_achievement_karl_hepp_rlb : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}	
?]
[? if not achievement_karl_hepp_rlb :	
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/karlhepprlb.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Landpopulistenurteil</strong> - Karl Hepp has been elected as president of the Reichslandbund (RLB). </div></div>!}
?]

Usually on-road achievement alongside Landlicher Zorn. Related to current position of right wing government.

= Gesamtlandliche Vertretung

[? if achievement_gesamtlandliche_vertretung :	
{!<div class="ach" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(20,20,20,0.15) 0%,rgba(120,180,120,0.15) 33%,rgba(30,90,30,0.15) 66%,rgba(10,40,10,0.15) 100%)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(90,90,90,0.3)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/gesamtlandliche_vertretung.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Gesamtlandliche Vertretung</strong> - The Green Front encompasses maximal amount of members possible.!}[? if game_achievement_gesamtlandliche_vertretung : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}	
?]
[? if not achievement_gesamtlandliche_vertretung :	
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/gesamtlandliche_vertretung.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Gesamtlandliche Vertretung</strong> - The Green Front encompasses the maximum amount of members possible.</div></div>!}
?]

Hint: Karl Hepp is mandatory here.

= Annahmeerklarung

[? if achievement_annahmeerklarung :	
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(15,35,70,0.15)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(15,35,70,0.35)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/annahmeerklarung.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Annahmeerklärung</strong> - Republicans by the dishonority, not of the reason.!}[? if game_achievement_annahmeerklarung : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}	
?]
[? if not achievement_annahmeerklarung :	
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/annahmeerklarung.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Annahmeerklärung</strong> - Republicans by the dishonority, not of the reason.</div></div>!}
?]

Hint: Do not alienate Stahlhelm ever but at the same time crush nationalist tendencies in the country.

= Herbstingwer

[? if achievement_herbstingwer :	
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(225,135,25,0.15)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(225,135,25,0.35)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/herbstingwer.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Herbstingwer</strong> - Ernst Niekisch and his <strong>national socialists</strong> have survived the test of the time.!}[? if game_achievement_herbstingwer : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}	
?]
[? if not achievement_herbstingwer :	
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/herbstingwer.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Herbstingwer</strong> - Ernst Niekisch and his <strong>national socialists</strong> have survived the test of the time.</div></div>!}
?]

For that matter, even I didn't get this achievement as of now.

= Im Staun Der Zeit

[? if achievement_im_staub_der_zeit :	
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(128,0,0,0.94)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(225,135,25,0.35)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/im_staub_der_zeit.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Im Staub der Zeit</strong> - Ultimate failure of the fortunes.!}[? if game_achievement_im_staub_der_zeit : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}	
?]
[? if not achievement_im_staub_der_zeit :	
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/im_staub_der_zeit.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Im Staub der Zeit</strong> - Ultimate failure of the fortunes.</div></div>!}
?]

Hint: Pay attention to news, first condition is "Urban Plan". Second condition is whether was NSDAP funded in Young Plan campaigning by someone certain. Sometime around, Hitler is challenged.

= Liberalismus

[? if achievement_liberalismus :
{!<div class="ach" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.06),rgba(0,60,120,0.06))"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/liberalismus.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>United Liberalism</strong> - Liberal movement has been unified.!}[? if game_achievement_liberalismus : {!<span class="ach-new">New!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}
?]
[? if not achievement_liberalismus :
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/liberalismus.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>United Liberalism</strong> - Liberal movement has been unified.</div></div>!}
?]

Hint: Stresemann's reform **must** pass.

= Großer Korporatismus

[? if achievement_lambachreich :
{!<div class="ach" style="background:rgba(40,40,40,0.15)"><div class="ach-icon-box" style="background:rgba(40,40,40,0.3)"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/lambachreich.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Großer Korporatismus</strong> - Walther Lambach has managed to consolidate power under himself.!}[? if game_achievement_lambachreich : {!<span class="ach-new">Neu!</span>!}?]{!</div></div>!}
?]
[? if not achievement_lambachreich :
{!<div class="ach ach-locked"><div class="ach-icon-box"><img class="ach-icon" src="img/achievements/lambachreich.png"></div><div class="ach-body"><strong>Großer Korporatismus</strong> - Walther Lambach has managed to consolidated power under himself.</div></div>!}
?]

Hint: Lambach wins the DNVP congress. Afterwards, everything is intuitive here.

